
sequenceDiagram
    actor Przełożony
    actor Pracownik
    participant WebApp as Internal Web App
    participant Gateway as Internal API Gateway
    participant EmployeeService as Employee Service
    participant EmployeeAuth as Employee Auth Service
    participant EventBus as Event Bus
    participant NotificationService as Notification Service

    Przełożony->>WebApp: Tworzy profil pracownika
    WebApp->>Gateway: POST /employees
    Gateway->>EmployeeService: POST /employees
    EmployeeService->>EmployeeService: Zapisuje dane pracownika
    EmployeeService->>EventBus: EmployeeProfileCreated
    EmployeeService-->>Gateway: 201 Created
    Gateway-->>WebApp: 201 Created
    WebApp-->>Przełożony: Profil utworzony

    EventBus->>EmployeeAuth: EmployeeProfileCreated
    EmployeeAuth->>EmployeeAuth: Tworzy konto PENDING
    EmployeeAuth->>EmployeeAuth: Generuje token aktywacyjny (24h)
    EmployeeAuth->>EventBus: EmployeeActivationTokenCreated

    EventBus->>NotificationService: EmployeeActivationTokenCreated
    NotificationService->>NotificationService: Zapisuje dane kontaktowe
    NotificationService->>Pracownik: Link aktywacyjny (zaproszenie)

    Pracownik->>WebApp: Klika link aktywacyjny
    WebApp->>Gateway: POST /auth/activate?token=xyz
    Gateway->>EmployeeAuth: POST /auth/activate?token=xyz
    EmployeeAuth->>EmployeeAuth: Weryfikuje token

    alt Token poprawny
        Pracownik->>WebApp: Ustawia hasło
        WebApp->>Gateway: POST /auth/set-password
        Gateway->>EmployeeAuth: POST /auth/set-password
        EmployeeAuth->>EmployeeAuth: Konto → ACTIVE
        EmployeeAuth->>EventBus: EmployeeAccountActivated
        EmployeeAuth-->>Gateway: 200 OK
        Gateway-->>WebApp: 200 OK
        WebApp-->>Pracownik: Konto aktywowane

        EventBus->>EmployeeService: EmployeeAccountActivated
        EmployeeService->>EmployeeService: Synchronizuje status pracownika → ACTIVE
    else Token niepoprawny
        EmployeeAuth-->>Gateway: 400 Bad Request
        Gateway-->>WebApp: 400 Bad Request
        WebApp-->>Pracownik: Link nieprawidłowy lub wygasły
    end
